{"id": "hsh-oversight-declined", "title": "City declined to put homelessness contract renewals back before its watchdog", "seconds": 130.3, "voice": "elevenlabs:9PVP7ENhDskL0KYHAKtD", "narrator": "Jerry B.", "tempo": 1.127, "made": "2026-11-24", "key": "dd65c85248e64e4d", "words": 392, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[9]"], "text": "San Francisco’s homelessness department pays nonprofits to run shelters and housing.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.82, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "Homelessness and Supportive Housing", "sub": "pays nonprofits to run shelters and housing"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.23, 0.75, 1.2, 1.62, 1.88, 2.45, 2.58, 2.77, 3.16, 3.26]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[9]"], "text": "How much in fiscal 2025?", "t0": 3.94, "t1": 5.89, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "Homelessness and Supportive Housing", "sub": "pays nonprofits to run shelters and housing"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.38, 0.48, 0.79, 1.05]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[9]", "amount"], "text": "487 million dollars.", "t0": 5.89, "t1": 7.6, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$487 million", "label": "to nonprofits, fiscal 2025", "sub": "about 30 percent of City nonprofit spending"}, "emph": ["487"], "wt": [0.04, 0.27, 0.5, 1.04, 1.33]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[11]"], "text": "In 2022, voters created its watchdog: the Homelessness Oversight Commission.", "t0": 8.12, "t1": 12.87, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Homelessness Oversight Commission", "sub": "created by voters, Proposition C, 2022"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.46, 1.33, 1.7, 2.11, 2.26, 3.17, 3.3, 3.84, 4.29]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[2]", "established[0]"], "text": "In June 2026, a civil grand jury reported on it.", "t0": 12.99, "t1": 15.85, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Civil grand jury", "sub": "At Scale, At Risk, June 23, 2026"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.39, 0.63, 1.33, 1.46, 1.73, 1.97, 2.24, 2.63, 2.76]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[2]", "established[0]"], "text": "These are official findings.", "t0": 15.97, "t1": 17.15, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Civil grand jury", "sub": "At Scale, At Risk, June 23, 2026"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.32, 0.69]}, {"scene": "find1", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "First: renewals used to go before the commission.", "t0": 17.37, "t1": 19.76, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2025-05-01", "to": "2026-06-23", "days": "", "fromLab": "review ended", "toLab": "grand jury report", "kicker": "The first finding"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.74, 1.16, 1.32, 1.42, 1.6, 1.85, 1.95]}, {"scene": "find1", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "On May 1, 2025, that stopped.", "t0": 19.88, "t1": 22.3, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2025-05-01", "to": "2026-06-23", "days": "", "fromLab": "review ended", "toLab": "grand jury report", "kicker": "The first finding"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.41, 0.69, 0.96, 1.83, 2.07]}, {"scene": "find1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why", "story[1]"], "text": "Why? The director cited administrative burden.", "t0": 22.42, "t1": 25.1, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "citing administrative burden"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.85, 1.0, 1.43, 1.77, 2.33]}, {"scene": "find2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[2]"], "text": "Second: in August 2025, the commission approved an extension for Urban Alchemy at 711 Post Street.", "t0": 25.32, "t1": 31.1, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Urban Alchemy, 711 Post Street", "kicker": "The second finding", "sub": "August 7, 2025, six months"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.81, 0.97, 1.22, 1.45, 2.3, 2.42, 2.77, 3.15, 3.26, 3.72, 3.88, 4.19, 4.57, 4.7, 4.99, 5.31, 5.52]}, {"scene": "find2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[2]"], "text": "How much?", "t0": 31.22, "t1": 31.93, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Urban Alchemy, 711 Post Street", "kicker": "The second finding", "sub": "August 7, 2025, six months"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15]}, {"scene": "find2", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what", "established[2]"], "text": "4 million dollars.", "t0": 31.93, "t1": 32.83, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$4 million", "label": "a six-month extension", "sub": "approved without discussion"}, "emph": ["4"], "wt": [0.04, 0.27, 0.54]}, {"scene": "find2", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what", "established[2]"], "text": "The staff report mentioned no staffing, safety or community concerns.", "t0": 33.35, "t1": 36.53, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["staffing concerns", "safety concerns", "community concerns"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.08, 0.36, 0.69, 1.0, 1.16, 1.74, 2.16, 2.28, 2.66]}, {"scene": "find2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1].why", "established[12]"], "text": "Yet the Controller had listed this nonprofit as one that must fix problems.", "t0": 36.65, "t1": 39.89, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Tier 2 corrective-action list", "kicker": "The second finding", "sub": "the Controller, 2025"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.26, 0.71, 0.83, 1.11, 1.29, 1.84, 1.99, 2.22, 2.35, 2.53, 2.76]}, {"scene": "find2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1].why", "established[12]"], "text": "It disputes the overspending figure.", "t0": 40.01, "t1": 41.61, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Tier 2 corrective-action list", "kicker": "The second finding", "sub": "the Controller, 2025"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.59, 0.72, 1.27]}, {"scene": "find3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[10]", "established[5]", "suspicious[3]"], "text": "Third: the department doesn’t use incident reports to spot dangerous patterns.", "t0": 41.83, "t1": 45.61, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "No way to compare", "kicker": "The third finding", "sub": "Finding F1: incident reports not used"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.71, 0.85, 1.29, 1.58, 1.83, 2.17, 2.53, 2.65, 2.98, 3.35]}, {"scene": "find3", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what", "established[3]"], "text": "The fix comes later:", "t0": 45.73, "t1": 47.11, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2026-11-12", "to": "2027-12-01", "days": "", "fromLab": "today", "toLab": "data triggers promised", "kicker": "The third finding"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.39, 0.64]}, {"scene": "find3", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what", "established[3]"], "text": "outlier providers by March 2027, warning signs by December 2027.", "t0": 47.11, "t1": 51.52, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2026-11-12", "to": "2027-12-01", "days": "", "fromLab": "today", "toLab": "data triggers promised", "kicker": "The third finding"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.46, 0.91, 1.06, 1.29, 1.52, 2.52, 2.84, 3.13, 3.24, 3.64, 3.87]}, {"scene": "ask", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[1]", "story[2]"], "text": "Its ask:", "t0": 51.74, "t1": 52.81, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Recommendation R3.1", "kicker": "The ask", "sub": "by December 2026"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.23]}, {"scene": "ask", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[1]", "story[2]"], "text": "renewals back before the commission by December 2026. Who said yes?", "t0": 52.81, "t1": 57.15, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Recommendation R3.1", "kicker": "The ask", "sub": "by December 2026"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.47, 0.68, 0.94, 1.03, 1.44, 1.6, 2.0, 2.25, 3.21, 3.43, 3.67]}, {"scene": "ask", "kind": "slam", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[3]", "established[4]"], "text": "No one.", "t0": 57.15, "t1": 57.64, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "slam", "words": ["No", "one."], "sub": "Mayor, department and Board all declined"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.29]}, {"scene": "ask", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what", "established[3]", "story[3]"], "text": "In August 2026, the Mayor and the department turned it down.", "t0": 58.16, "t1": 61.34, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "will not be implemented"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.4, 0.65, 1.49, 1.66, 1.9, 1.99, 2.09, 2.51, 2.75, 2.84]}, {"scene": "ask", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what", "established[3]", "story[3]"], "text": "Because, they said, it adds work, not oversight.", "t0": 61.46, "t1": 63.97, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "will not be implemented"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.36, 0.53, 0.94, 1.11, 1.34, 1.81, 2.02]}, {"scene": "ask", "kind": "sfmap", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what", "established[4]"], "text": "Then the Board of Supervisors passed Resolution 555-26: not warranted.", "t0": 64.09, "t1": 69.03, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "sfmap", "pins": [{"place": "cityhall", "name": "Board of Supervisors", "sub": "Resolution 555-26"}], "zoomOn": "board", "scale": 1.9, "kicker": "September 29, 2026"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.28, 0.5, 0.58, 1.23, 1.52, 2.1, 2.37, 2.63, 4.25, 4.47]}, {"scene": "ask", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["established[5]", "established[6]"], "text": "The Board agreed providers can’t be compared, and still said no.", "t0": 69.15, "t1": 72.24, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["Board agrees", "no way to compare providers"], "b": ["Board on R3.1", "not warranted"], "kicker": "Commission: R3.1 needs further analysis"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.32, 0.61, 1.05, 1.28, 1.4, 2.0, 2.21, 2.52, 2.79]}, {"scene": "ask", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["established[5]", "established[6]"], "text": "The commission wants more study.", "t0": 72.36, "t1": 73.69, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["Board agrees", "no way to compare providers"], "b": ["Board on R3.1", "not warranted"], "kicker": "Commission: R3.1 needs further analysis"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.49, 0.75, 0.94]}, {"scene": "ask", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[15]"], "text": "Its public dashboards still report system totals only, nothing by provider.", "t0": 73.81, "t1": 77.4, "shot": "b17d", "visual": {"type": "quote", "kicker": "The department’s dashboards, 21 November 2026", "line": "system totals only: none broken out by provider"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.46, 0.94, 1.17, 1.49, 1.81, 2.14, 2.69, 3.0, 3.14]}, {"scene": "ask", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[13]"], "text": "It wasn’t the first ask. In 2022-23, a grand jury wanted outcome measures in these contracts.", "t0": 77.52, "t1": 83.39, "shot": "b17g", "visual": {"type": "doc", "kicker": "An earlier ask, 2022-23", "source": "gj1", "text": "asked for consistent outcome measures and monitoring standards in homelessness contracts", "mark": "outcome measures"}, "emph": ["2022-23"], "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.42, 0.52, 0.81, 1.55, 1.71, 2.01, 2.46, 2.55, 3.32, 3.49, 3.8, 4.1, 4.4, 4.73, 5.03, 5.14, 5.33]}, {"scene": "ask", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[13]"], "text": "By 2025, the department still said “in the future.", "t0": 83.51, "t1": 86.58, "shot": "b17g", "visual": {"type": "doc", "kicker": "An earlier ask, 2022-23", "source": "gj1", "text": "asked for consistent outcome measures and monitoring standards in homelessness contracts", "mark": "outcome measures"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.41, 1.2, 1.32, 1.73, 2.0, 2.29, 2.51, 2.63]}, {"scene": "ask", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[13]"], "text": "The contracting office said no. The Mayor’s office didn’t answer.", "t0": 86.7, "t1": 89.98, "shot": "b17g", "visual": {"type": "doc", "kicker": "An earlier ask, 2022-23", "source": "gj1", "text": "asked for consistent outcome measures and monitoring standards in homelessness contracts", "mark": "outcome measures"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.65, 0.92, 1.18, 1.88, 2.04, 2.36, 2.66, 2.92]}, {"scene": "find4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[8]"], "text": "Fourth: a former commissioner never filed her financial-interest forms or finished training.", "t0": 90.2, "t1": 94.44, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Ethics Commission case 26-1031", "kicker": "The fourth finding", "sub": "September 11, 2026"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.66, 0.8, 1.1, 1.62, 1.86, 2.15, 2.27, 2.98, 3.38, 3.58, 3.85]}, {"scene": "find4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[8]"], "text": "At how many meetings did she act anyway?", "t0": 94.56, "t1": 97.07, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Ethics Commission case 26-1031", "kicker": "The fourth finding", "sub": "September 11, 2026"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.29, 0.5, 0.8, 0.93, 1.1, 1.3]}, {"scene": "find4", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[4].what", "established[8]"], "text": "10.", "t0": 97.07, "t1": 97.45, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "10", "label": "meetings while disqualified", "sub": "a $2,300 penalty"}, "emph": ["10"], "wt": [0.04]}, {"scene": "find4", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[4].why", "established[8]"], "text": "She paid a 2,300 dollar penalty. No financial effect on her interests was found.", "t0": 97.97, "t1": 102.74, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "no financial effect on her interests"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.46, 0.54, 0.76, 1.15, 1.37, 1.61, 1.88, 2.77, 2.98, 3.43, 3.74, 3.85, 3.98, 4.27, 4.41]}, {"scene": "find4", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["established[14]", "notEstablished[4]"], "text": "And a member listed for 2026 is an officer of Mercy Housing California,", "t0": 102.86, "t1": 107.12, "shot": "b20m", "visual": {"type": "chain", "kicker": "A name match, confirmed by Form 700", "steps": [{"art": "gavel", "name": "Housing Authority Commission", "sub": "a seat in the 2026 listing"}, {"art": "contract", "name": "Mercy Housing California", "sub": "the member is an officer"}, {"art": "money", "name": "The City", "sub": "paid it $40.4 million in all"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.25, 0.53, 0.82, 0.95, 1.24, 2.01, 2.23, 2.33, 2.67, 2.74, 3.03, 3.36]}, {"scene": "find4", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["established[14]", "notEstablished[4]"], "text": "who sits on the Housing Authority Commission, not this one.", "t0": 107.12, "t1": 109.88, "shot": "b20m", "visual": {"type": "chain", "kicker": "A name match, confirmed by Form 700", "steps": [{"art": "gavel", "name": "Housing Authority Commission", "sub": "a seat in the 2026 listing"}, {"art": "contract", "name": "Mercy Housing California", "sub": "the member is an officer"}, {"art": "money", "name": "The City", "sub": "paid it $40.4 million in all"}]}, "emph": ["Housing Authority"], "wt": [0.04, 0.23, 0.46, 0.57, 0.67, 0.99, 1.38, 2.09, 2.33, 2.55]}, {"scene": "find4", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["established[14]", "notEstablished[4]"], "text": "Did that member step aside? The recusal notices on file don’t say.", "t0": 110.0, "t1": 113.44, "shot": "b20m", "visual": {"type": "chain", "kicker": "A name match, confirmed by Form 700", "steps": [{"art": "gavel", "name": "Housing Authority Commission", "sub": "a seat in the 2026 listing"}, {"art": "contract", "name": "Mercy Housing California", "sub": "the member is an officer"}, {"art": "money", "name": "The City", "sub": "paid it $40.4 million in all"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.32, 0.55, 0.78, 1.52, 1.68, 2.09, 2.47, 2.64, 2.93, 3.14]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "span", "ref": ["established[7]", "story[4]"], "text": "The Mayor promises to re-bid every contract by May 2029.", "t0": 113.66, "t1": 116.85, "shot": "b21", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2026-08-31", "to": "2029-05-01", "days": "", "fromLab": "plan announced", "toLab": "all contracts re-bid", "kicker": "What comes next"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.35, 0.76, 0.91, 1.31, 1.54, 2.02, 2.22, 2.39, 2.64]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "notEstablished[1]", "notEstablished[2]"], "text": "No one has found an improper renewal or stolen money,", "t0": 116.97, "t1": 119.47, "shot": "b22", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Any improper renewal", "Any money stolen", "How many renewals since May 2025"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.32, 0.44, 0.69, 0.78, 1.22, 1.61, 1.71, 2.06]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "notEstablished[1]", "notEstablished[2]"], "text": "or counted the renewals since May 2025.", "t0": 119.47, "t1": 121.74, "shot": "b22", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Any improper renewal", "Any money stolen", "How many renewals since May 2025"]}, "wt": [0.04, 0.26, 0.54, 0.66, 1.02, 1.26, 1.43, 1.68]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[0]"], "text": "What would settle it?", "t0": 121.86, "t1": 122.95, "shot": "b23", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "A list of every renewal since May 1, 2025"}, {"who": "", "what": "What each approver knew"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.34, 0.63]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[0]"], "text": "A list of every renewal since May 1, 2025, and what each approver knew.", "t0": 122.95, "t1": 127.37, "shot": "b23", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "A list of every renewal since May 1, 2025"}, {"who": "", "what": "What each approver knew"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.04, 0.21, 0.43, 0.55, 0.81, 1.22, 1.49, 1.72, 2.03, 2.33, 3.15, 3.38, 3.56, 3.75, 4.17]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["end"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 127.49, "t1": 129.36, "shot": "b25", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.28, 0.56, 0.7, 0.91, 0.98, 1.08, 1.3, 1.55]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "The question", "find1": "Finding 1 · review ended", "find2": "Finding 2 · $4 million, no concerns", "find3": "Finding 3 · no data checks", "ask": "The ask · declined three times", "find4": "Finding 4 · 10 meetings", "close": "Where it stands"}, "look": "terminal", "hook": "que